@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 120
hide footbox
title Allpatek | Account registration, token and current profile
actor Visitor
participant "Angular SPA" as Web
participant "IAM / REST" as IAM
participant "User service + JPA" as U
participant "Token / BCrypt services" as Sec
participant "Profiles" as P
Visitor -> Web : Register an account
Web -> IAM : POST /api/v1/users (public)
IAM -> U : SignUpCommand; resolve roles, check username
U -> Sec : Encode password with BCrypt
U -> U : Persist account and roles
IAM --> Web : Created user
Web -> IAM : POST /api/v1/tokens (public)
IAM -> U : SignInCommand; load user and compare credentials
alt Credentials accepted
  U -> Sec : Generate signed JWT for the username
  IAM -> P : Resolve optional profile ID via facade
  IAM --> Web : Authenticated user, token and nullable profile ID
  opt Registration flow creates a separate profile
    Web -> P : POST /api/v1/profiles with bearer token
  end
  Web -> IAM : Protected request with Authorization: Bearer …
  IAM -> Sec : Filter validates token and reads username
  IAM -> U : Load user and authorities; set security context
  IAM --> Web : Continue to the requested resource
else Sign-in fails
  IAM --> Web : Error response; no token
end
note over IAM,P : Account and profile are separate operations.\nA valid token does not by itself establish ownership of a business record.
@enduml
